<title>JAPAN: Dai-Ichi Mutual 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dai-Ichi Mutual 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	  (in billions yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Premium income		 1.92 trln   vs	    2.10 trln</p>
<p> Asset Invest Gains	 502.90	  vs	  630.50</p>
<p> Insurance Payments	   2.18 trln   vs	    1.27 trln</p>
<p> Asset invest costs	 126.10	  vs	  134.20</p>
<p> Total assets		  27.23 trln   vs	   26.93 trln</p>
<p> Unrealised equ pft	   2.28 trln   vs	    1.43 trln</p>
<p>NOTE - Dai-Ichi Mutual Life Insurance Co is the full company name.</p>
</text>
